      "description": "The four treatises with the canzoni as verse (one line per verse, hard breaks) and Dante’s paragraph numbers. Wiki templates, footnote anchors and authority links are dropped. Chapter ids are trattato-N-cap-NN; the canzone of treatises II, III and IV stands as its own chapter before chapter 1.",
